{"parse": {"title": "高频偏振", "pageid": 2289, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"高频偏振\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/68/Item-180003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"高频偏振\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>高频偏振</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#180003</div></div><hr /><div>凝汇的余振，不足以成像。用于突破心相等级上限的高阶材料。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">频率较高，观测难度偏低，出现概率较少于低频偏振振幅。多产生自情绪强烈而短暂的心影成像，例似愤怒、冲动或贪婪。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">荒原合成</td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">迷途鉴定</td></tr></tbody></table><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">配方</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/180002\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BD%8E%E9%A2%91%E5%81%8F%E6%8C%AF\" title=\"低频偏振\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bge